title: LibraryComplete
---
<<SetControlContext "Cutscene">>
<<CameraZoom 5 2 0.9>>
<<PanToLocation 10 2 10 2>>
Ylru: My friends... I have to find them.
<<UnitMoveToPos "Ylru" 9 -7>>
Ylru runs to the dorms, worried about his friends.
<<PanToLocation 10 -6 10 2>>
<<wait 1>>
<<UnitMoveToPosNoBlock "Ylru" 20 -7>>
<<PanToLocation 20 -6 10 1>>
The hallway stretches long and dark. His footsteps echo.
Ylru: They're fine. They're fine. It's me — 
Ylru: it's just me.
<<UnitMoveToPosNoBlock "Ylru" 35 -7>>
<<PanToLocation 36 -6 10 1>>
The air hums—low, like a heartbeat behind the walls.
<<FireEvent "globallightdark">>
<<PanToLocation 36 6 10 1>>
<<UnitMoveToPos "Ylru" 35 4>>
In the darkness, he listens closely, hoping for the sound of soft sleeping breath or the stirring of one of his friends.
<<wait 1>>
He is met only with silence.
Ylru: ...Hello....?
<<wait 1>>
<<FadeInBlack 0.01>>
<<FireEvent "lightson">>
<<wait 0.2>>
<<FadeOutBlack 0.01>>
<<wait 2>>
<<PanToLocation 36 8 10 0.5>>
<<PanToLocation 36 4 10 0.5>>
<<wait 1>>
Ylru: ...Twelve help me.
<<wait 1>>
The stones underfoot hum like they're remembering something.
Ylru's primal urges kick in, and he has only one thought.
<<wait 1>>
Flee.
He has to make it out of the academy.
Through whatever this is.
<<wait 1>>
<<UnitMoveToPos "Ylru" 35 -7>>
<<FireEvent "globallightdim">>
<<PanToLocation 36 -6 10 1>>
